  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Those that fell your friends face your bloody rampage of revenge.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Blood Vengeance<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When attacking the creature whose attack reduced your ally below 0 hit points and triggered your blood vengeance, you deal 1 point of bleed damage and your critical threat range is increased by 1. If you confirm a critical hit, you deal 1d4 points of bleed damage. This bleed damage stacks.</p>\n<p>While raging with this feat, you can make an Intimidate check as a move action against the target of your blood vengeance. If you have previously struck the target this round, you add your mythic tier as a bonus on this Intimidate check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
